      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 10,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Métricas del Hito 2\n- **Latencia:** `published_ts_ms` en el publicador vs reloj al recibir en el suscriptor (aprox. RTT + broker; no incluye colas internas del sensor).\n- **Frecuencia:** contador de mensajes recibidos en el suscriptor por etiqueta `zona` (equivalente a publicaciones exitosas que llegan).\n- **Volumen:** bytes de payload MQTT; bytes estimados por insert en MongoDB; y tamaño de colección vía *mongodb_exporter* (`$collStats`).\n\n**Grafana:** admin / admin  ·  **Prometheus:** :9090"
      },
      "title": "Guía",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 3 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (zona, le) (rate(iot_mqtt_publish_to_subscribe_latency_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 {{zona}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (zona, le) (rate(iot_mqtt_publish_to_subscribe_latency_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50 {{zona}}",
          "hide": false,
          "range": true,
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Latencia publicador → suscriptor (s)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
